    {
      "id": "claim_14886588c7954746a2c230c40715d2d7",
      "statement": "Nothing in the repository calls slugify() except its own pytest suite test_slugify.py, which imports it via `from slugify import slugify`; the unrelated README.md networking runbook never references it. The test suite is the only consumer pinning the function's contract, so any behavior change to slugify.py must be paired with matching assertions in test_slugify.py.",
